{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55457","headline":"半阳湖 · 朱存","name":"半阳湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南龙节水爲乡，水不纯（《六朝事迹编类》作「绝」）阴又半阳。\n一片湖光共深浅，两般泉脉异温凉。\n（同前卷十八。\n又见《六朝事迹编类》卷上。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}